      "message_uk": "Академічний огляд залишив зауваження до готової роботи.",
      "detail": "PASS\nCoherent, well-structured thesis on remote worker monitoring and data protection. Claims are properly sourced with pinpoint citations to legislation, case law (Cassazione, ECtHR Bărbulescu/López Ribalda), Garante provvedimenti, and doctrine. Consistent APA-style referencing; bibliography matches in-text citations. Notably honest about evidentiary limits, repeatedly flagging where sources do not support generalization. Minor issue: the Bărbulescu Grand Chamber judgment is dated 5 September 2017 in references but text once says 'deliberando l'8 giugno 2017' — a small date inconsistency, not material to argument. Overall methodologically sound and internally consistent.",
